<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO asset management posts 39 pct rise.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO asset management posts 39 pct rise.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Tuesday the value of funds managed by its asset management arm rose 39 percent to 117 billion guilders at the end of 1996 from 84 billion at the end of 1995.</p>
</text>
